\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02JA_new_exact.py}
& Exact integral and mod-two invariant spaces, exterior powers, primitive kernels and marking matrices for the three named sphere families.
See \cref{maps:src:B.4.1,maps:src:B.1.1}. \\[3pt]
\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02JC_fresh_arithmetic.py}
\par\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02JC_comparison_arithmetic.py}
& Monodromy and integral coordinate maps, coinvariants, core kernels, cusp mixed cycles, normal circles and the tube matrix of determinant $-1$.
See \cref{maps:src:B.5.2}. \\[3pt]
\nolinkurl{code/kummer_normal_cover.py}
\par\nolinkurl{code/kummer_orbits.py}
& Normal-cover and finite Kummer-orbit calculations.
See \cref{maps:src:C.1.4,maps:src:C.1.5}. \\[3pt]
\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02K5_fresh_orbit.py}
& Integral Kummer identities for $1\leq N\leq64$.
See \cref{maps:src:C.1.4}. \\[3pt]
\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02K5_exterior_orbit.py}
\par\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02K6_schreier_kernel.py}
& Exterior and unit-projective orbits for $2\leq N\leq8$; Schreier kernels and characters for $N=2,3,4$.
See \cref{maps:src:C.1.4,maps:src:C.1.5}. \\[3pt]
\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02KC_fresh_linear.py}
\par\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02KC_postrelease_matrix_comparison.py}
& Exact rational attachment and character matrices, their full inverses, and the symbolic $B/D$ coordinate transport.
See \cref{maps:src:D.1.3}. \\[3pt]
\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02KD_fresh_arithmetic.py}
\par\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02KD_comparison_arithmetic.py}
& Integral intersections, image and quotient inverses, norm averages and signed finite-order coefficient maps of orders three and four.
See \cref{maps:src:D.1.4}. \\[3pt]
\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02KF_fresh_ring.py}
& Curve intersections, normal-disc chain and ruling inverse; both signs for $d\in\{1,5,7,11,13,17,19,25,31,49,101\}$, with cyclic ring matrices for $d>1$.
See \cref{maps:src:D.1.6}. \\[3pt]
\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02KG_fresh_family.py}
& Symbolic finite orders, invariant columns, integral period change, $-d$ scaling, cusp cocycle, coherent even shifts, fan maps and parameter radii.
See \cref{maps:src:D.1.7}. \\[3pt]
\nolinkurl{code/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_III_02KH_fresh_scalar.py}
& Symbolic covering-torus and scalar-line coordinate identities, including the marked quadratic expression.
